"pretty large sum of money, averaging around $5,000/mo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/sponsors.rst:13
msgid ""
"`Cloudflare`_ - Cloudflare is providing us with an enterprise plan of "
"their SSL for SaaS Providers product that enables us to provide SSL "
"certificates for custom domains."
